      "updated": 1786287168802,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Delhi University students need a platform to buy and sell used\nbooks. Seller list their books with a price and buyers browse\nor search. When a book is purchased, the seller marks it as sold. ",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Delhi University students need a platform to buy and sell used\nbooks. Seller list their books with a price and buyers browse\nor search. When a book is purchased, the seller marks it as sold. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "cuEq8H4tkIsZ9onoUOUOW",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 648,
      "y": 377,
      "width": 708.4033203125,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a1",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1079054693,
      "version": 249,
      "versionNonce": 1460014053,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786287272630,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A REST API for a college book exchange with:\n- User registration (name, email, college)\n- Book listings with search by title or author\n- Mark books as sold\n- API key authentication on write operations",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A REST API for a college book exchange with:\n- User registration (name, email, college)\n- Book listings with search by title or author\n- Mark books as sold\n- API key authentication on write operations",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
